{
    "title": "Sticker GO!",
    "description": "Sticker GO! is the first app that helps you complete your Monopoly GO! album and get rewards and dice as soon as they\u2019re available!\r\nUsing it is super easy \u2013 just update your album on Sticker GO! every time you receive a new sticker on Monopoly GO!, and you can automatically receive or make exchange proposals with our entire community!\r\nFor each user, you can check the number of completed and uncompleted trades, giving you a reliability index to avoid losing your stickers!\r\n\r\nYou can also redeem dice and rewards every day with a simple tap in the dice section!\r\n\r\nInside the app, there are many sections to stay updated on tournaments and events in Monopoly GO!\r\nYou can also try your luck with the Lucky Wheel and win a rare sticker every day!\r\n\r\nWith push notifications, you\u2019ll stay updated in real-time on new proposals and friend requests!\r\n\r\nWhat are you waiting for? Download the app and see how easy it is to complete your Monopoly GO! album!\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.stickergo.app/privacy-policy/\r\nTerms and Conditions: https://www.stickergo.app/terms-of-use/",
    "descriptionHTML": "Sticker GO! is the first app that helps you complete your Monopoly GO! album and get rewards and dice as soon as they\u2019re available!<br>Using it is super easy \u2013 just update your album on Sticker GO! every time you receive a new sticker on Monopoly GO!, and you can automatically receive or make exchange proposals with our entire community!<br>For each user, you can check the number of completed and uncompleted trades, giving you a reliability index to avoid losing your stickers!<br><br>You can also redeem dice and rewards every day with a simple tap in the dice section!<br><br>Inside the app, there are many sections to stay updated on tournaments and events in Monopoly GO!<br>You can also try your luck with the Lucky Wheel and win a rare sticker every day!<br><br>With push notifications, you\u2019ll stay updated in real-time on new proposals and friend requests!<br><br>What are you waiting for? Download the app and see how easy it is to complete your Monopoly GO! album!<br><br>Privacy Policy: https://www.stickergo.app/privacy-policy/<br>Terms and Conditions: https://www.stickergo.app/terms-of-use/",
